WEBVTT

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:36.890 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.960 line:0%
[Episode 14]

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:01.950 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.570 line:0%
What are you here for?

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:23.080 line:0%
There are too many lanterns, and it's too bright here.

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:24.590 line:0%
Over here.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:25.950 line:0%
Put it here.

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:29.510 line:0%
Is the Grand Commander's Mansion always like this?

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.760 line:0%
Shen's Mansion is much brighter than this.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.650 line:0%
Grand Commander, here.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:49.560 line:0%
Mr. Han,

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.810 line:0%
on such a night with a full moon,

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:54.760 line:0%
do you, like me,

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.600 line:0%
think of your family?

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.080 line:0%
I...

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.660 line:0%
My parents passed away early.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.700 line:0%
I have long been without family.

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.970 line:0%
Once I marry Caiwei,

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.060 line:0%
Yan's Mansion will be my home.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.080 line:0%
Yes, yes.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.040 line:0%
Your parents are gone,

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:23.610 line:0%
but what about your siblings?

00:03:25.879 --> 00:03:26.800 line:0%
Marriage is a big deal.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.760 line:0%
Out of courtesy,

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.160 line:0%
shouldn't you at least inform them?

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.330 line:0%
Before the wedding,

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.150 line:0%
the two families should meet.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:35.960 line:0%
Yes, yes.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.220 line:0%
That's not necessary.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.600 line:0%
I left home to study from a young age

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:45.030 line:0%
and have long lost contact with my relatives.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.760 line:0%
As long as Caiwei and I truly love each other,

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:47.620 line:0%
that is enough.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.040 line:0%
I don't care for

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.730 line:0%
all these formalities.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.600 line:0%
Is that so?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:55.760 line:0%
I actually think

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:56.960 line:0%
these formalities

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.680 line:0%
are quite necessary.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.370 line:0%
Even if two people are truly in love,

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:04.400 line:0%
they would still hope

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.440 line:0%
to receive recognition and blessings

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.570 line:0%
from each other's family and friends.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:10.940 line:0%
More importantly,

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:13.080 line:0%
through such a meeting,

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.690 line:0%
both families can understand each other's background,

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.120 line:0%
so they won't be deceived.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:30.860 line:0%
Yes, yes.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.560 line:0%
When the Grand Commander and I got married,

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.770 line:0%
we didn't follow all the formalities either.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:39.170 line:0%
What matters most is that Mr. Han

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.730 line:0%
truly loves Sister Caiwei.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:56.950 line:0%
It's getting late,

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.800 line:0%
and there's a bit of a chill in the air.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.750 line:0%
How about we

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.090 line:0%
each go back to our rooms and rest?

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:15.200 line:0%
Yes.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.480 line:0%
Let's go then.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:17.280 line:0%
Yes, yes.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:18.680 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.280 line:0%
we'll head back to rest now.

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:22.630 line:0%
Let's go.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:23.600 line:0%
Mr. Han.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.440 line:0%
If you and Caiwei truly and sincerely

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.480 line:0%
love each other,

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.230 line:0%
then you should not be afraid to be honest

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:33.030 line:0%
and face everything together.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:39.560 line:0%
Shiyuan,

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.320 line:0%
let's go.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.790 line:0%
What are you trying to do?

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.440 line:0%
You insisted on coming to Yan's Mansion for dinner

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.840 line:0%
and scared everyone off.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.980 line:0%
I didn't want to say it either.

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:57.600 line:0%
Even if I had to,

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.600 line:0%
it shouldn't have been me saying it.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:00.680 line:0%
You're

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:01.160 line:0%
just

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:01.730 line:0%
making things

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.460 line:0%
mysterious.

00:06:40.209 --> 00:06:41.400 line:0%
It's getting late.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.440 line:0%
Let's go back.

00:06:43.459 --> 00:06:45.790 line:0%
It's so late, and you're still going back?

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.209 line:0%
-Well…
-Grand Commander.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:50.750 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.760 line:0%
Our Master has prepared a bedroom

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.060 line:0%
for you and your wife.

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.320 line:0%
Since my father

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:58.390 line:0%
has already prepared a bedroom for me,

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.950 line:0%
I won't be going back.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.660 line:0%
Honey, please feel free to do as you wish.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.010 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.190 line:0%
What am I doing?

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.280 line:0%
He said they have prepared

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:18.600 line:0%
a bedroom for us.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.000 line:0%
If you stay,

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:22.350 line:0%
how will you explain this tomorrow?

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:24.080 line:0%
Well, even if you're not leaving,

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.540 line:0%
at least put me down first.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.940 line:0%
It's not good if someone sees us.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:30.140 line:0%
So what if they see?

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:32.240 line:0%
I want them to see,

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.290 line:0%
to confirm that we are a harmonious couple.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.290 line:0%
That way, you won't have to explain.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:40.690 line:0%
Wait...

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.590 line:0%
Let's go back and rest.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:54.680 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:07:58.020 --> 00:07:59.580 line:0%
The show is over now.

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:00.670 line:0%
It's time to sleep.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:07.260 line:0%
Yan's Mansion is not like Shen's Mansion.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.760 line:0%
Tonight, you can make do

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:09.720 line:0%
and sleep there.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.840 line:0%
I'm an injured person.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:25.920 line:0%
You want me to sleep on a bamboo chair?

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.740 line:0%
That doesn't seem right, does it?

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:29.860 line:0%
But you look...

00:08:32.599 --> 00:08:34.820 line:0%
healthier than I do.

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:40.680 line:0%
Fine, fine.

00:08:40.709 --> 00:08:42.109 line:0%
I'll let you have the bed.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.840 line:0%
If you want to stay,

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.850 line:0%
there's still space on the inside of the bed.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.290 line:0%
You can sleep on the inside.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.420 line:0%
If you don't want to,

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.700 line:0%
you can choose to go outside

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.840 line:0%
and sleep under the stars for the night.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:16.870 line:0%
Let's make do

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.440 line:0%
and sleep like this for tonight.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:19.400 line:0%
But we need to set some

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:20.290 line:0%
ground rules.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:21.440 line:0%
No one is allowed

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.970 line:0%
to cross over this blanket.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.590 line:0%
I can't sleep.

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:29.640 line:0%
I might as well go out

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:31.570 line:0%
and sleep under the stars and moon.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:14.700 line:0%
Why are you here too?

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.320 line:0%
I've already given you the room.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.660 line:0%
The candles in the room are out.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.300 line:0%
It's too dark. I can't sleep.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:34.560 line:0%
Hurry and have someone

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:35.800 line:0%
relight the candles.

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:37.590 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:38.800 line:0%
it's the middle of the night.

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.600 line:0%
You just have to bother others, don't you?

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:41.480 line:0%
When the candles were lit,

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:42.730 line:0%
you weren't asleep either.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:43.760 line:0%
You were tossing and turning,

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.820 line:0%
making it impossible for me to sleep.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:49.600 line:0%
Because even when the candles were lit,

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.000 line:0%
it wasn't bright enough.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.040 line:0%
It was still a bit dim.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.920 line:0%
You're really a strange person.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.440 line:0%
My father even specifically

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.640 line:0%
lit a few more candelabras tonight,

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:06.760 line:0%
and you still think it's too dim?

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:07.480 line:0%
You're sleeping,

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:08.560 line:0%
not reading or writing.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.280 line:0%
Why does it have to be so bright?

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.540 line:0%
It's not like you're blind and can't see.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:18.040 line:0%
Now I understand

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.800 line:0%
why Shen Du is called the White Ghost.

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.240 line:0%
Look at all these.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:23.840 line:0%
During the day, it already looked like a mourning hall.

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:25.080 line:0%
At night,

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.970 line:0%
it's still as bright as daylight.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.080 line:0%
Who carries a lantern

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:29.960 line:0%
to beat someone up?

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.690 line:0%
I can't do it without a lantern.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:34.250 line:0%
Could it be...

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:13.150 line:0%
He has night blindness?

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:27.960 line:0%
Tonight is really rare.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.320 line:0%
Look.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:32.810 line:0%
The Azure Dragon Seven Stars in the east.

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:35.160 line:0%
And...

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.120 line:0%
the Vermilion Bird Seven Stars in the south.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:42.100 line:0%
You can see them all.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.350 line:0%
Look over there.

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:50.700 line:0%
The four stars connected over there.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:53.490 line:0%
Don't they look like the four corners of a square?

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:56.960 line:0%
Those four over there

00:14:56.960 --> 00:14:58.490 line:0%
are Di Tu He Constellation.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:14:59.850 line:0%
Below them, there are four more,

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:01.980 line:0%
which are Jiao Mu Jiao Constellation.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.030 line:0%
He really can't see.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.220 line:0%
There are no stars over there at all.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:10.800 line:0%
You know so many

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.020 line:0%
constellation names.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:13.740 line:0%
You're really impressive.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:16.600 line:0%
So, what about that one over there?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.960 line:0%
The one that looks like a rabbit?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.160 line:0%
What's the name of that constellation?

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.510 line:0%
It's called Bi Yue Wu Constellation.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.280 line:0%
And this one here?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.120 line:0%
I think this one

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:33.740 line:0%
looks like a flower rice cake.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.880 line:0%
Also, the one to the south.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:35.880 line:0%
The one to the south

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:37.360 line:0%
looks like

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:38.680 line:0%
the outline of a cherry.

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.680 line:0%
It's called Jing Mu Han Constellation.

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:41.480 line:0%
That doesn't sound good.

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:43.210 line:0%
Let's give it a different name.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.960 line:0%
I think

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:47.620 line:0%
it should be called

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.600 line:0%
the Cherry Pastry Constellation.

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.080 line:0%
The one next to it

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.480 line:0%
should be called the Flower Rice Cake Constellation.

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:54.170 line:0%
How are these names pleasant to the ear?

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:55.720 line:0%
Such strange names.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.170 line:0%
And they're all names of pastries.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.520 line:0%
You don't understand, do you?

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.420 line:0%
It's the best to name them after food.

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:03.660 line:0%
When I was little, I didn't have a good appetite.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.520 line:0%
My mom gave every star in the sky

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.160 line:0%
a pastry name.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.480 line:0%
She even lied to me, saying that if a certain star was shining,

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:10.800 line:0%
I had to eat more of that particular pastry.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:11.560 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:12.240 line:0%
that star

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.850 line:0%
would never shine again.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:16.900 line:0%
Today,

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.400 line:0%
you should eat a few more flower rice cakes.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.000 line:0%
Because tonight,

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.080 line:0%
the star that looks like a flower rice cake is shining.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.240 line:0%
My mom said that

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.170 line:0%
if we don't do it,

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.040 line:0%
the star that looks like a flower rice cake

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.340 line:0%
will dim.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:31.450 line:0%
Hurry up and eat.

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:39.160 line:0%
♫My heart burned, leaving me cold and forlorn♫

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:41.790 line:0%
♫And a lifetime of loneliness♫

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:46.190 line:0%
♫My love blazed. Where did it scatter♫

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.550 line:0%
♫And where did it leave its marks?♫

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:52.190 line:0%
♫Drifting through the mist♫

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:56.880 line:0%
♫Amidst the vast, endless waves, I searched in the darkness♫

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:01.980 line:0%
♫You passed by, igniting fireworks♫

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.159 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:09.700 line:0%
♫For the sake of an end, I embraced silence and became a Shura♫

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.450 line:0%
Could it...

00:17:08.409 --> 00:17:09.430 line:0%
be you?

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:16.490 line:0%
♫Love is elusive, piercing you and burning me♫

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:22.510 line:0%
♫Along the way, flowers bloom and fall, rain pours heavily♫

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:25.360 line:0%
♫Lights will cross♫

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:30.240 line:0%
♫You are my destination♫

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.510 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my loneliness and confusion?♫

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.510 line:0%
♫Understanding my fragility, no words are needed♫

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.830 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my panic and obsession?♫

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.440 line:0%
♫Sheltering my solitude, never letting me fall♫

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:49.400 line:0%
♫The chains of fate between us cannot be broken♫

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:54.280 line:0%
♫Holding the warmth you once gave♫

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:59.200 line:0%
♫Guiding me to see myself, the person I truly am♫

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.270 line:0%
♫Who will save me from right and wrong?♫

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.580 line:0%
♫Tossed in the sea of people, just hold me tight♫

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.390 line:0%
♫Who will save me from grudges and karma?♫

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:13.690 line:0%
♫Healing my sorrow, never letting me escape♫

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.790 line:0%
♫The past fades, how many times have we met?♫

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.740 line:0%
♫Who can break free from destiny?♫

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:29.350 line:0%
♫I'll cross rivers and leap into fire for you♫

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.710 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:36.410 line:0%
♫I'm willing to disappear with you in the hustle and bustle♫

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:54.580 line:0%
what is it?

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:55.920 line:0%
Early this morning,

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:57.080 line:0%
Mr. Han went to find the master

00:18:57.080 --> 00:18:58.600 line:0%
and said he had something to announce.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:18:59.400 line:0%
He asked me to come

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.620 line:0%
and invite you and your wife to be there too.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.430 line:0%
Alright.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:06.820 line:0%
We'll go right away.

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:18.520 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:19.920 line:0%
No need for formalities.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:21.720 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.480 line:0%
you're here.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.440 line:0%
Thank you

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.680 line:0%
for giving me the opportunity to tell the truth myself.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.480 line:0%
Shiyuan,

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.810 line:0%
what exactly do you want to say?

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:35.600 line:0%
Caiwei.

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:37.940 line:0%
I lied to you.

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:42.040 line:0%
My parents still have one son alive.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.320 line:0%
He is the minion of the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:45.980 line:0%
the Deputy Minister of Rites,

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.490 line:0%
Zhang Baohuan.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.170 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang?

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.290 line:0%
But there's one thing I don't understand.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.560 line:0%
Since you're Deputy Minister Zhang's brother,

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:03.280 line:0%
why didn't he

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.730 line:0%
use his connections to protect you

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.930 line:0%
from the persecution of Princess Ying?

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:08.730 line:0%
Brother?

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:11.480 line:0%
It was only after Princess Ying learned about

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.480 line:0%
my relationship with Zhang Baohuan

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:14.880 line:0%
that she, with the intention of challenging

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:16.410 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:18.390 line:0%
wanted to make me her paramour.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:23.940 line:0%
I repeatedly rejected her

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.040 line:0%
but couldn't escape.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:28.400 line:0%
Though we share the same mother,

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:30.600 line:0%
he doesn't deserve to be my brother.

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:34.200 line:0%
He didn't protect my sister.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.230 line:0%
Sister?

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:44.020 line:0%
Was the owner of Jinxiu Workshop back then

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:45.960 line:0%
your sister, Zhang Baoying?

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:51.540 line:0%
Caiwei,

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.420 line:0%
I'm sorry.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:55.930 line:0%
I lied to you.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:00.220 line:0%
When the incident of Jinxiu Workshop happened,

00:21:00.220 --> 00:21:02.350 line:0%
our entire Zhang family was executed.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.240 line:0%
But Zhang Baohuan used his connections

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.120 line:0%
and saved me.

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.060 line:0%
I've never understood why,

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:08.840 line:0%
since he could save me,

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:10.780 line:0%
he didn't save my sister.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:13.580 line:0%
I resent him for not protecting my sister,

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.300 line:0%
and I resent myself for being powerless.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.170 line:0%
From that moment on,

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:19.760 line:0%
I made up my mind

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.920 line:0%
to sever all ties with the Zhang family.

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:26.000 line:0%
My mother's surname was Han,

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.130 line:0%
so I took her surname

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.290 line:0%
and changed my name to Han Shiyuan.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:38.440 line:0%
Perhaps he also has his own

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:40.040 line:0%
unavoidable difficulties.

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.520 line:0%
You should know how difficult it is

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:43.840 line:0%
for him to be

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:45.490 line:0%
by the Grand Empress Dowager's side.

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:47.350 line:0%
Serving the ruler is like living with a tiger.

00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:48.410 line:0%
You understand it,

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:50.040 line:0%
right?

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:56.440 line:0%
You have never seen the scene

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:58.240 line:0%
where blood flowed like a river.

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:01.480 line:0%
How could you truly empathize?

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.400 line:0%
Don't be afraid.

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:11.680 line:0%
[Zhang Baoying]

00:22:25.590 --> 00:22:27.290 line:0%
I will never forget that day.

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:29.860 line:0%
If you were me,

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:33.400 line:0%
you wouldn't have said that.

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:46.960 line:0%
You're wrong.

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:51.150 line:0%
It's precisely because they died unjustly

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:53.000 line:0%
that you should rely on yourself

00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:53.880 line:0%
and do everything possible

00:22:53.880 --> 00:22:55.200 line:0%
to avenge them,

00:22:55.350 --> 00:22:57.410 line:0%
rather than deceiving yourself here

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:02.260 line:0%
and distancing yourself from them.

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:11.180 line:0%
A karmic bond.

00:23:15.510 --> 00:23:17.590 line:0%
It's a karmic bond.

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:45.850 line:0%
Mr. Han,

00:23:48.670 --> 00:23:51.250 line:0%
please allow me to think the marriage between you

00:23:51.250 --> 00:23:53.050 line:0%
and my daughter over again.

00:23:54.290 --> 00:23:55.650 line:0%
I hope you understand.

00:23:56.930 --> 00:24:00.400 line:0%
The Yan family is just a small household.

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:04.570 line:0%
It really can't withstand any more storms.

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:18.100 line:0%
I knew the consequences

00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:21.920 line:0%
when I told you all these things today.

00:24:24.880 --> 00:24:26.410 line:0%
I couldn't sleep all night.

00:24:27.600 --> 00:24:28.320 line:0%
In the end, I realized

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:30.180 line:0%
I can't deceive Caiwei

00:24:32.130 --> 00:24:33.630 line:0%
while marrying her.

00:24:34.120 --> 00:24:35.980 line:0%
Living in your mansion these days

00:24:37.540 --> 00:24:39.020 line:0%
has caused you many troubles.

00:24:39.020 --> 00:24:39.820 line:0%
I...

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:43.060 line:0%
will take my leave.

00:24:49.180 --> 00:24:50.350 line:0%
Shiyuan!

00:24:51.080 --> 00:24:52.000 line:0%
Caiwei.

00:24:52.250 --> 00:24:53.170 line:0%
Caiwei.

00:25:30.640 --> 00:25:31.840 line:0%
This Mr. Han

00:25:32.080 --> 00:25:33.080 line:0%
is indeed Deputy Minister Zhang's

00:25:33.080 --> 00:25:34.210 line:0%
own flesh and blood.

00:25:37.340 --> 00:25:38.740 line:0%
The Jinxiu Workshop case

00:25:38.920 --> 00:25:40.440 line:0%
involves past secrets within the royal family

00:25:40.440 --> 00:25:42.200 line:0%
and has wide-ranging connections with close officials

00:25:42.200 --> 00:25:43.480 line:0%
of the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:25:43.480 --> 00:25:44.940 line:0%
You must act with caution.

00:25:45.800 --> 00:25:46.600 line:0%
I understand.

00:25:47.160 --> 00:25:48.160 line:0%
I will be careful.

00:25:52.600 --> 00:25:53.400 line:0%
Actually...

00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:56.290 line:0%
there's one more thing.

00:25:57.520 --> 00:25:59.320 line:0%
Back when I was in the Prisoner's Center,

00:25:59.320 --> 00:26:00.320 line:0%
a little girl

00:26:00.520 --> 00:26:02.120 line:0%
often came to see me at night,

00:26:02.330 --> 00:26:03.480 line:0%
bringing food

00:26:03.480 --> 00:26:05.280 line:0%
and news from the outside world.

00:26:06.150 --> 00:26:07.530 line:0%
But one day,

00:26:08.640 --> 00:26:09.920 line:0%
she stopped coming.

00:26:11.390 --> 00:26:12.320 line:0%
I thought

00:26:12.320 --> 00:26:14.780 line:0%
I would never see her again in this lifetime.

00:26:15.320 --> 00:26:16.350 line:0%
But yesterday,

00:26:19.080 --> 00:26:20.680 line:0%
I think I found her,

00:26:23.200 --> 00:26:24.290 line:0%
or someone

00:26:25.500 --> 00:26:27.380 line:0%
who looks very much like her.

00:26:28.560 --> 00:26:29.670 line:0%
Many years ago,

00:26:29.840 --> 00:26:30.880 line:0%
you asked me to check

00:26:30.880 --> 00:26:33.120 line:0%
the records of those who entered and exited the Prisoner's Center.

00:26:33.120 --> 00:26:34.240 line:0%
It was to find her,

00:26:34.480 --> 00:26:35.280 line:0%
wasn't it?

00:26:36.960 --> 00:26:38.240 line:0%
But there was no record

00:26:38.360 --> 00:26:40.020 line:0%
of a girl entering or leaving,

00:26:40.050 --> 00:26:41.750 line:0%
so I can't help but wonder

00:26:42.400 --> 00:26:44.160 line:0%
if this person truly exists

00:26:44.820 --> 00:26:46.540 line:0%
or if it was just a dream.

00:26:47.460 --> 00:26:49.520 line:0%
If she entered and and exited at night,

00:26:49.520 --> 00:26:50.280 line:0%
it's likely that

00:26:50.280 --> 00:26:52.250 line:0%
it wasn't recorded in the logs.

00:26:54.210 --> 00:26:55.940 line:0%
That place for criminal slaves

00:26:56.410 --> 00:26:58.870 line:0%
was also where I was once confined as a child.

00:26:59.770 --> 00:27:01.040 line:0%
Now, when I think back,

00:27:01.430 --> 00:27:03.160 line:0%
I still often have nightmares.

00:27:04.430 --> 00:27:05.610 line:0%
She must be a kind-hearted girl

00:27:05.610 --> 00:27:08.270 line:0%
to dare to go into the Prisoner's Center at night

00:27:08.320 --> 00:27:09.880 line:0%
to take care of you.

00:27:11.420 --> 00:27:12.400 line:0%
If you two are truly destined

00:27:12.400 --> 00:27:13.680 line:0%
and meet again,

00:27:14.640 --> 00:27:16.330 line:0%
you must treat her well.

00:27:22.480 --> 00:27:24.680 line:0%
If fate really brings us together again,

00:27:24.680 --> 00:27:26.940 line:0%
there's no need to recognize each other.

00:27:27.360 --> 00:27:28.800 line:0%
Now, I am the most notorious

00:27:28.800 --> 00:27:29.560 line:0%
cruel official

00:27:29.560 --> 00:27:30.880 line:0%
in Cang State—

00:27:31.290 --> 00:27:32.500 line:0%
brutal‌ and unjust,

00:27:32.840 --> 00:27:34.770 line:0%
using vicious dogs to harm people.

00:27:35.930 --> 00:27:37.040 line:0%
I have no face to meet

00:27:37.040 --> 00:27:38.700 line:0%
my childhood friend anymore.

00:27:38.960 --> 00:27:40.890 line:0%
Using vicious dogs to harm people?

00:27:41.510 --> 00:27:43.910 line:0%
Are you referring to the worship ceremony at Ming Hall?

00:27:43.910 --> 00:27:45.360 line:0%
If you hadn't released those vicious dogs

00:27:45.360 --> 00:27:46.800 line:0%
to help select criminals,

00:27:46.800 --> 00:27:48.280 line:0%
everyone in the audience

00:27:48.280 --> 00:27:50.810 line:0%
would have likely perished under the arrows.

00:27:51.720 --> 00:27:53.680 line:0%
Madam Xu, you've been living in the palace,

00:27:53.680 --> 00:27:55.180 line:0%
yet your vision reaches a thousand miles,

00:27:55.180 --> 00:27:56.800 line:0%
knowing everything about what happens outside the palace.

00:27:56.800 --> 00:27:58.360 line:0%
Don't flatter me.

00:27:58.420 --> 00:27:59.880 line:0%
This is well known

00:27:59.880 --> 00:28:01.410 line:0%
throughout Xiang'an City.

00:28:01.720 --> 00:28:02.480 line:0%
It has become

00:28:02.480 --> 00:28:04.120 line:0%
another crime under your name,

00:28:04.120 --> 00:28:05.240 line:0%
the White Ghost.

00:28:11.120 --> 00:28:11.920 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:28:13.480 --> 00:28:14.880 line:0%
do you think it's worth

00:28:16.000 --> 00:28:17.530 line:0%
bearing such a reputation?

00:28:25.270 --> 00:28:26.280 line:0%
Yan Xing!

00:28:26.680 --> 00:28:29.140 line:0%
You once again overstepped your authority!

00:28:32.370 --> 00:28:36.430 line:0%
And you say you didn't overstep your authority?

00:28:36.920 --> 00:28:38.160 line:0%
This is a classified file sent by

00:28:38.160 --> 00:28:39.200 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:28:39.200 --> 00:28:41.240 line:0%
addressed to you and only you.

00:28:42.720 --> 00:28:43.850 line:0%
Originally,

00:28:43.880 --> 00:28:45.280 line:0%
cases from the Imperial Security Bureau

00:28:45.280 --> 00:28:47.590 line:0%
were meant to be assigned to you.

00:28:50.040 --> 00:28:51.760 line:0%
But according to the protocol, they must first be archived

00:28:51.760 --> 00:28:53.080 line:0%
and then distributed from top to bottom.

00:28:53.080 --> 00:28:53.800 line:0%
How can it go directly into your hands

00:28:53.800 --> 00:28:55.730 line:0%
without passing through me first?

00:28:57.080 --> 00:28:57.800 line:0%
You must

00:28:57.800 --> 00:28:59.440 line:0%
s-seriously...

00:29:00.050 --> 00:29:02.650 line:0%
warn the Imperial Security Bureau about this.

00:29:06.290 --> 00:29:07.590 line:0%
Okay, Director Wu.

00:29:07.610 --> 00:29:08.770 line:0%
I will inform them.

00:29:08.800 --> 00:29:10.060 line:0%
All files and evidence sent over

00:29:10.060 --> 00:29:11.300 line:0%
must be reviewed

00:29:11.330 --> 00:29:12.150 line:0%
and approved by you

00:29:12.150 --> 00:29:14.590 line:0%
before being distributed.

00:29:14.620 --> 00:29:15.890 line:0%
That's more like it.

00:29:32.410 --> 00:29:33.890 line:0%
What is this?

00:29:34.260 --> 00:29:35.750 line:0%
Code words for landmarks?

00:29:37.450 --> 00:29:40.200 line:0%
Twisted Dough Cruller Constellation?

00:29:39.480 --> 00:29:42.290 line:0%
[Flower Rice Cake Constellation]

00:29:43.130 --> 00:29:46.400 line:0%
Flower Rice Cake Constellation?

00:29:47.250 --> 00:29:48.310 line:0%
Cherry...

00:29:55.190 --> 00:29:57.160 line:0%
This should be related to my husband's

00:29:57.160 --> 00:29:59.040 line:0%
recent interest

00:29:59.040 --> 00:30:00.200 line:0%
in astronomy.

00:30:00.480 --> 00:30:01.680 line:0%
He sketched the stars

00:30:01.680 --> 00:30:04.400 line:0%
while observing them

00:30:04.470 --> 00:30:06.040 line:0%
and gave the sketches to our Ministry of Justice

00:30:06.040 --> 00:30:07.720 line:0%
for case reference.

00:30:08.650 --> 00:30:10.630 line:0%
Ridiculous.

00:30:11.270 --> 00:30:12.800 line:0%
Are these things of any use to us?

00:30:12.800 --> 00:30:13.640 line:0%
Are they?

00:30:13.640 --> 00:30:14.440 line:0%
This is the Ministry of Justice,

00:30:14.440 --> 00:30:16.600 line:0%
not the Imperial Astronomer's Office.

00:30:16.600 --> 00:30:18.280 line:0%
Ridiculous.

00:30:18.330 --> 00:30:21.790 line:0%
He thinks we have nothing to do here in the Ministry of Justice?

00:30:30.010 --> 00:30:31.590 line:0%
Even without eating pastries,

00:30:31.590 --> 00:30:33.650 line:0%
you can still keep a sky full of stars.

00:30:33.910 --> 00:30:36.370 line:0%
It's impressive that he remembered

00:30:36.400 --> 00:30:39.030 line:0%
all the directions and names I made up last night.

00:30:39.030 --> 00:30:39.980 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:30:40.120 --> 00:30:40.840 line:0%
I will find a way

00:30:40.840 --> 00:30:42.730 line:0%
to cure your night blindness.

00:30:52.560 --> 00:30:55.150 line:0%
[Seaweed]

00:31:05.140 --> 00:31:08.110 line:0%
[Five taels of deer antler] [Ginseng]

00:31:06.240 --> 00:31:08.690 line:0%
The condition of being able to see clearly during the day

00:31:08.690 --> 00:31:10.950 line:0%
but not at night

00:31:11.020 --> 00:31:12.920 line:0%
[Four taels of plantain herb] [Eight taels of Ye Ming Sha]

00:31:11.880 --> 00:31:13.740 line:0%
is called night blindness.

00:31:14.170 --> 00:31:18.830 line:0%
Night blindness should be treated by nourishing the liver and replenishing blood.

00:31:20.510 --> 00:31:26.920 line:0%
[Four dried pigeons] [Five teals of Azurite]

00:31:28.360 --> 00:31:30.560 line:0%
These are the organs Madam had you prepared

00:31:30.560 --> 00:31:32.470 line:0%
for Master's daily meals?

00:31:50.890 --> 00:31:52.520 line:0%
You're cooking?

00:31:58.430 --> 00:32:01.040 line:0%
It looks more like you're cultivating.

00:32:01.780 --> 00:32:03.990 line:0%
Why are you all gathered here?

00:32:10.440 --> 00:32:11.870 line:0%
Stop gathering here!

00:32:11.900 --> 00:32:13.780 line:0%
Don't you have work to do?

00:32:13.880 --> 00:32:15.270 line:0%
Pipewort?

00:32:17.610 --> 00:32:19.400 line:0%
Get back to work.

00:32:20.200 --> 00:32:21.000 line:0%
Alright.

00:32:22.250 --> 00:32:23.160 line:0%
Hurry, hurry.

00:32:23.200 --> 00:32:24.180 line:0%
Follow me!

00:32:31.600 --> 00:32:32.940 line:0%
Ye Ming Sha.

00:32:58.480 --> 00:32:59.400 line:0%
Master,

00:33:00.360 --> 00:33:02.830 line:0%
this is Immortal's Lamb Liver Soup

00:33:03.180 --> 00:33:04.910 line:0%
Madam prepared for you.

00:34:57.400 --> 00:34:58.290 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:34:58.290 --> 00:34:59.600 line:0%
Madam instructed you

00:34:59.800 --> 00:35:01.200 line:0%
to have a bowl of...

00:35:01.280 --> 00:35:03.280 line:0%
chicken liver steamed with pipewort and Ye Ming Sha for lunch.

00:35:03.280 --> 00:35:04.360 line:0%
Again for lunch?

00:35:05.970 --> 00:35:07.710 line:0%
When will this ever end?

00:35:09.340 --> 00:35:10.320 line:0%
I won't eat it.

00:35:21.520 --> 00:35:22.440 line:0%
I know why

00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:24.040 line:0%
you light the lamps at night.

00:35:24.200 --> 00:35:26.020 line:0%
If you want to see the starry sky,

00:35:26.160 --> 00:35:28.180 line:0%
you need to eat them three times a day.

00:35:28.180 --> 00:35:29.380 line:0%
If you don't eat,

00:35:29.520 --> 00:35:30.770 line:0%
read the second page.

00:35:36.120 --> 00:35:37.920 line:0%
If you don't want everyone in Xiang'an City

00:35:37.920 --> 00:35:39.280 line:0%
to know the secret of the White Ghost,

00:35:39.280 --> 00:35:41.610 line:0%
you'd better nourish yourself properly.

00:35:53.440 --> 00:35:54.560 line:0%
What did you just

00:35:54.560 --> 00:35:55.340 line:0%
call this damn thing?

00:35:55.340 --> 00:35:55.940 line:0%
Chicken

00:35:55.970 --> 00:35:56.610 line:0%
liver

00:35:56.630 --> 00:35:57.470 line:0%
steamed

00:35:57.500 --> 00:35:58.250 line:0%
with

00:35:58.270 --> 00:35:59.030 line:0%
pipewort

00:35:59.060 --> 00:35:59.760 line:0%
and

00:35:59.790 --> 00:36:00.710 line:0%
Ye

00:36:00.730 --> 00:36:01.530 line:0%
Ming

00:36:01.560 --> 00:36:01.960 line:0%
Sha.

00:36:03.430 --> 00:36:04.990 line:0%
I know what pipewort is,

00:36:05.400 --> 00:36:06.950 line:0%
but what is

00:36:07.220 --> 00:36:08.180 line:0%
Ye Ming Sha?

00:36:08.630 --> 00:36:09.630 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:36:10.560 --> 00:36:12.490 line:0%
are you sure you want me to tell you?

00:36:13.550 --> 00:36:15.460 line:0%
What is it?

00:36:15.880 --> 00:36:17.160 line:0%
Bat feces.

00:36:23.480 --> 00:36:24.560 line:0%
Damn

00:36:25.290 --> 00:36:26.220 line:0%
Yan

00:36:26.480 --> 00:36:27.610 line:0%
Xing!

00:36:29.040 --> 00:36:30.040 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:36:30.220 --> 00:36:31.820 line:0%
why don't you just not eat it?

00:36:46.010 --> 00:36:47.730 line:0%
Go to the Ministry of Justice

00:36:48.040 --> 00:36:50.990 line:0%
and invite her to the Imperial Security Bureau!

00:37:11.060 --> 00:37:20.180 line:0%
[Grand Commander's Office]

00:37:20.400 --> 00:37:21.930 line:0%
Madam, you must be careful.

00:37:22.520 --> 00:37:23.480 line:0%
After the Grand Commander ate the chicken liver,

00:37:23.480 --> 00:37:24.810 line:0%
he wasn't in a good mood.

00:37:29.350 --> 00:37:32.010 line:0%
I'll go check on the Imperial Guard's training.

00:37:38.490 --> 00:37:39.820 line:0%
What are you looking at?

00:37:41.000 --> 00:37:41.800 line:0%
And you.

00:37:45.550 --> 00:37:46.540 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:37:46.880 --> 00:37:48.380 line:0%
if you want to murder your husband,

00:37:48.380 --> 00:37:49.850 line:0%
just stab me with a sword.

00:37:49.880 --> 00:37:51.440 line:0%
Why did you go through all this trouble,

00:37:51.440 --> 00:37:53.480 line:0%
making these nauseating soups?

00:37:54.540 --> 00:37:55.500 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:37:55.640 --> 00:37:57.190 line:0%
you're truly ungrateful.

00:37:57.470 --> 00:37:58.760 line:0%
I searched through

00:37:58.760 --> 00:37:59.640 line:0%
all the medical books

00:37:59.640 --> 00:38:01.090 line:0%
and came up with these recipes myself.

00:38:01.090 --> 00:38:02.950 line:0%
According to ancient medical books,

00:38:02.950 --> 00:38:04.730 line:0%
night blindness should be treated

00:38:04.730 --> 00:38:06.440 line:0%
with liver-nourishing and eyesight-improving foods,

00:38:06.440 --> 00:38:08.120 line:0%
such as animal organs and...

00:38:08.140 --> 00:38:09.470 line:0%
Not just animal organs,

00:38:09.550 --> 00:38:10.810 line:0%
but also animal feces!

00:38:10.820 --> 00:38:12.520 line:0%
What animal feces?

00:38:19.330 --> 00:38:21.320 line:0%
Are you talking about...

00:38:23.300 --> 00:38:24.520 line:0%
Ye Ming Sha?

00:38:32.410 --> 00:38:33.420 line:0%
That...

00:38:34.090 --> 00:38:37.690 line:0%
chicken liver steamed with pipewort and Ye Ming Sha

00:38:39.270 --> 00:38:40.810 line:0%
is recorded...

00:38:42.260 --> 00:38:43.520 line:0%
in General Treatise on the Causes

00:38:43.520 --> 00:38:44.730 line:0%
and Symptoms of Diseases.

00:38:44.730 --> 00:38:45.880 line:0%
Ye Ming Sha

00:38:45.900 --> 00:38:48.200 line:0%
is the most important medicinal ingredient in it.

00:38:48.200 --> 00:38:48.920 line:0%
Mr. Shen

00:38:48.920 --> 00:38:50.360 line:0%
went to pharmacies all over the city

00:38:50.360 --> 00:38:51.440 line:0%
to buy it for you.

00:38:51.440 --> 00:38:53.040 line:0%
I spent the whole night steaming it.

00:38:53.040 --> 00:38:53.520 line:0%
Don't think

00:38:53.520 --> 00:38:55.480 line:0%
I have a black heart and am harming you.

00:38:55.480 --> 00:38:57.240 line:0%
Don't mention organs anymore.

00:39:00.960 --> 00:39:02.950 line:0%
Good medicine tastes bitter.

00:39:03.200 --> 00:39:04.560 line:0%
There's no point

00:39:04.560 --> 00:39:06.160 line:0%
in venting your anger like this.

00:39:06.160 --> 00:39:06.800 line:0%
I...

00:39:07.450 --> 00:39:08.560 line:0%
If you don't have anything important

00:39:08.560 --> 00:39:09.080 line:0%
to say,

00:39:09.080 --> 00:39:10.040 line:0%
I'll be heading back to the Ministry of Justice.

00:39:10.040 --> 00:39:10.840 line:0%
Chen Shoujie has been recuperating

00:39:10.840 --> 00:39:12.010 line:0%
at the clinic these past few days.

00:39:12.010 --> 00:39:14.740 line:0%
He's sometimes clear-headed, sometimes dazed.

00:39:16.010 --> 00:39:18.420 line:0%
I've brought him to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:39:18.420 --> 00:39:19.920 line:0%
If you want to ask him anything,

00:39:19.920 --> 00:39:20.840 line:0%
just follow me.

00:39:51.120 --> 00:39:51.920 line:0%
Mr. Chen,

00:39:51.920 --> 00:39:52.600 line:0%
can you tell me

00:39:52.600 --> 00:39:54.000 line:0%
what exactly happened?

00:39:54.120 --> 00:39:54.960 line:0%
Why do you have

00:39:54.960 --> 00:39:57.560 line:0%
embroidery from Jinxiu Workshop in your home?

00:40:06.490 --> 00:40:08.000 line:0%
She's my second wife.

00:40:08.580 --> 00:40:10.280 line:0%
She used to work at Jinxiu Workshop

00:40:10.280 --> 00:40:11.590 line:0%
as an embroiderer.

00:40:11.610 --> 00:40:13.070 line:0%
She even had apprentices.

00:40:13.370 --> 00:40:15.560 line:0%
Her skills are truly impressive.

00:40:17.500 --> 00:40:19.440 line:0%
When the Jinxiu Workshop case happened,

00:40:19.440 --> 00:40:21.550 line:0%
she just happened to be away on other business.

00:40:21.550 --> 00:40:23.770 line:0%
Afterward, when the court was searching for the remaining culprits,

00:40:23.770 --> 00:40:24.970 line:0%
she went into hiding

00:40:25.970 --> 00:40:27.310 line:0%
and eventually met me.

00:40:28.550 --> 00:40:30.420 line:0%
Seeing how hard-working she was,

00:40:30.740 --> 00:40:32.780 line:0%
I married her as my second wife.

00:40:33.380 --> 00:40:34.540 line:0%
These embroideries

00:40:35.090 --> 00:40:37.180 line:0%
were all made by her to pass the time,

00:40:37.950 --> 00:40:40.350 line:0%
as she's accustomed to embroidery work.

00:40:51.040 --> 00:40:51.840 line:0%
Fire.

00:40:53.960 --> 00:40:54.760 line:0%
Fire.

00:40:56.600 --> 00:40:57.520 line:0%
From him,

00:40:58.800 --> 00:41:01.260 line:0%
we probably won't get any more information.

00:41:09.520 --> 00:41:10.760 line:0%
So Mrs. Chen

00:41:10.760 --> 00:41:12.840 line:0%
used to be an embroiderer at Jinxiu Workshop.

00:41:12.840 --> 00:41:14.570 line:0%
The suspect's motive for killing and silencing her

00:41:14.570 --> 00:41:15.640 line:0%
was likely

00:41:15.640 --> 00:41:17.520 line:0%
to eliminate everyone connected to Jinxiu Workshop

00:41:17.520 --> 00:41:18.770 line:0%
in one fell swoop.

00:41:19.320 --> 00:41:20.380 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:41:20.480 --> 00:41:21.840 line:0%
does it mean

00:41:22.520 --> 00:41:24.130 line:0%
there's a big secret

00:41:24.280 --> 00:41:26.040 line:0%
behind the Jinxiu Workshop case?

00:41:26.040 --> 00:41:27.960 line:0%
A secret so significant that the suspect is willing to kill

00:41:27.960 --> 00:41:29.720 line:0%
to keep it from being revealed?

00:41:29.880 --> 00:41:31.920 line:0%
But right now, all of this is just our speculation,

00:41:31.920 --> 00:41:33.200 line:0%
with no evidence to support it.

00:41:33.200 --> 00:41:34.000 line:0%
Indeed.

00:41:34.350 --> 00:41:35.920 line:0%
We need to investigate further,

00:41:35.920 --> 00:41:36.760 line:0%
and it needs to be

00:41:36.760 --> 00:41:38.290 line:0%
a targeted investigation.

00:41:38.360 --> 00:41:39.400 line:0%
I've decided

00:41:39.840 --> 00:41:41.160 line:0%
to write a request today

00:41:41.160 --> 00:41:42.770 line:0%
and submit it to the Ministry of Justice tomorrow,

00:41:42.770 --> 00:41:44.640 line:0%
applying to merge the Chen Huo'e case

00:41:44.640 --> 00:41:45.680 line:0%
with the Jinxiu Workshop case

00:41:45.680 --> 00:41:47.660 line:0%
for joint investigation and trial.

00:41:47.660 --> 00:41:49.200 line:0%
I'm afraid it will be difficult.

00:41:49.200 --> 00:41:49.880 line:0%
These two cases

00:41:49.880 --> 00:41:51.280 line:0%
involve too many people.

00:41:51.300 --> 00:41:53.090 line:0%
All of them don't want the old case to be reopened.

00:41:53.090 --> 00:41:54.160 line:0%
They'll do everything they can

00:41:54.160 --> 00:41:55.320 line:0%
to obstruct the investigation.

00:41:55.320 --> 00:41:56.560 line:0%
But how would you know the outcome

00:41:56.560 --> 00:41:58.040 line:0%
if you don't try?

00:42:00.340 --> 00:42:01.580 line:0%
[Treasure Hall]

00:42:03.920 --> 00:42:04.850 line:0%
What's going on?

00:42:05.200 --> 00:42:05.960 line:0%
Ahead, people from Princess Ying's Mansion

00:42:05.960 --> 00:42:06.880 line:0%
are causing trouble for Han Shiyuan.

00:42:06.880 --> 00:42:08.340 line:0%
They're blocking the way.

00:42:13.520 --> 00:42:14.320 line:0%
Mr. Han,

00:42:14.400 --> 00:42:17.060 line:0%
we're inviting you to Princess Ying's Mansion.

00:42:17.840 --> 00:42:18.640 line:0%
Wait.

00:42:19.090 --> 00:42:20.090 line:0%
Don't act rashly.

00:42:20.440 --> 00:42:21.240 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:42:21.830 --> 00:42:23.230 line:0%
quickly go and find Zhang Baohuan.

00:42:23.230 --> 00:42:23.880 line:0%
Yes.